   542	
   543	`{"name", "rule"}`. Names: `start-unknown` and `pre-start` (`LIFE`), `i9-section2-waived` (`I9S2`), `everify-authorized`
   312	
   313	### 7.1 `LIFE`: start-date lifecycle
   314	
   315	- **Read set:** `S.startDate`. **Input facts:** that fact.
   316	
   317	| Row | Condition | Outputs |
   318	| --- | --- | --- |
   319	| 1 | `S.startDate = ⊥` | flag `start-unknown` |
